1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,180
July 2024 brought Forever — a summer single that let the vocals breathe.

2
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:10,567
November 1st, 2024 brought the first full-length statement: DRIP.

3
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:13,556
Eight hundred twenty thousand first-week copies.

4
00:00:13,556 --> 00:00:15,631
A million in domestic sales.

5
00:00:15,631 --> 00:00:18,698
Billboard 200 entry at one forty-nine.

6
00:00:18,698 --> 00:00:20,837
RIAJ platinum in Japan.

7
00:00:20,837 --> 00:00:30,476
And on the title track, a guest verse from G-Dragon — the king of the label personally appearing on the heirs' record, which in Y-G terms is a coronation.

